    "detailed_description": "Awakening in the woods, you must find your way out. The further you venture, the more monsters that will come for you. Use your trusty flashlight and arsenal of tools to fend them off until day.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n-variety of monster types with different behaviors, sounds, and personalities<br />\r\n-small arsenal of tools designed to provide different uses in aiding the player's survival<br />\r\n-level up and perk chart as player advances<br />\r\n-unlimited gameplay mode<br />\r\n-different ending depending on player choices<br />\r\n-atmospheric forest maze with plenty of ambience for an unsettling first experience",
    "about_the_game": "Awakening in the woods, you must find your way out. The further you venture, the more monsters that will come for you. Use your trusty flashlight and arsenal of tools to fend them off until day.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n-variety of monster types with different behaviors, sounds, and personalities<br />\r\n-small arsenal of tools designed to provide different uses in aiding the player's survival<br />\r\n-level up and perk chart as player advances<br />\r\n-unlimited gameplay mode<br />\r\n-different ending depending on player choices<br />\r\n-atmospheric forest maze with plenty of ambience for an unsettling first experience",
    "short_description": "'Labyrinthian: Lost 'Til Dawn' is a horror maze/puzzle game where the player advances deeper into the maze-like forest to maintain survival, trying to last until day. This game uses mouse and keyboard controls (WASD), with other keys gaining functionality as the game progresses.",
